# v2 git bundle
-0efbd44755b07b1bffb7a51c010992fe11a6142f CHANGELOG: the GB10 handbook range as the fixed build measured it
-e7c523ebfa16b8094cf9e35e3773a7d25befcc5b Living Weights: the fact finder's list helper is listed, not take, which the lesson module already names
-d1018b318fb51981c4a18f12e40269a4d3ee9713 app tests: keep the test certificate's serial a minimal DER integer
-da275a3606462b17de35a017b13ed4777a10ea18 lanes cost cache: stream the executable into the window-cost key
-958efa3bf2e906f33e8121ae8bbded8eab6c5eb8 Merge pull request #1203 from ashhart/codex/beta9-google-recovery
-2e33e297d609bfcb0fcb30a7a89a81127ab55e45 fix(glm): queue requests when the context pool is temporarily full
-1b4f2f97956b49795df70a4d2db6538c9bcf7fe7 ci: the macOS dev-tools job compiles in Debug (compile and link only; its first run took 22 minutes)
-c0c7bd24fe0d3c04bf9237c17a4a877291277f96 Changelog: GLM-5.3-Flash image turns reuse the kept tower rows, and vision_tower. checkpoints load
-40c6406b3deb290aa3ec8ced310bc1c8896d160c Changelog: the keyed sampler race (#1337) and Dory KV pages (#1284); one --spill-gib entry
-e9b69ed707a4a39f259a2a730a858aa736dbaca4 Changelog: Flash Next shared rounds (#1338-#1343)
-3f408b6ec52464031292d7ce906f95d3b8032588 qwen4 host tests: isnan and isfinite by bits, so MinGW's and glibc's math macros can't rename them; no COFF bodies object on Windows
-8c36359d533debdbb8f53a4229b0bb9362c9c783 docs: the Orchestrator's /v1 is its remote-control API, not an OpenAI-compatible one
-ee896951d8294e9d62316a26af62b60840bb710f Changelog: KV pool page counts kept as pages change hands
-59044397a0e3870b01062fb67cde898a43b9a911 Release 1.1.7: the version, install examples and changelog
-b30d5b9d36786ff778b4bb7a7e1c4b5d26de126e FSR: the worker thread takes the engine threads' stack, and Windows exports _errno
-3f144ccf8ea466d9d29043cabc180795ee4a211c Changelog for the 1.1.7 batch; Metal link advice in its own file
-6eaa4cd5c814dbe526a1d6eb34c042142e63aee9 Changelog: an opt-in stop when the reasoning-loop guard fires
-c6df96cfd01db92b32badf1e2c09f578e6daca25 CI: a pull request's newer push cancels its older No GPU run, and pull requests check release paths on Linux only
-faccd11c83aceed6f68aa7a01a62affe7f9d508e docs: voice descriptions in the catalog and /v1/voices
-ea01ae189d54f91cacf66a87ac5874d9a1641239 contract: tf_glm_select_rows (128 threads) records its launch, a changed kernel
-3dfd41fc15f7c0d7da60daa82512c8ad461aaeba server: the serving line names its draft sources instead of "drafts: on"
-e4cc630f589c6a5a0fbea422eb25834e695c9c96 Changelog: Qwen 27B's fused BF16 prompt launches on CUDA (#1439), GLM's wide decode select (#1424), its indexer split across ranks (#1404) and its share-billed prompt step ending on the GPU (#1352)
-dd0a9cc5e503c405a71856631bfeabbccd97169f tools: cuda_sass_identity.py digests five-digit addresses and each instruction's second encoding word
-52254266e601794f49023185e2fb40b9b6d15a29 Changelog: Nemotron's priced draft depth (#1115), Flash Next's NVFP4 decode waves (#1351), Qwen 27B whole-window prefill (#1458), the release path check (#1533) and the Qwen3.5-2B prompt cache on Metal (#505)
